  "details": "Since the december 12th patch i have not been able to leave any map i set as my homemap. When i try to teleport out i am taken to a black void. The game did not crash, yet it does not seem to be doing anything. The game works perfectly normal beyond that - i just simply cant leave my home map. I have tried for days now many different fixes with no positive results: reinstalling vrchat/oculus/steamvr, clearing cache, making sure gamefiles are intact, deleting some dll file related to audiooculusspacial, changing dns, deleting hamachi, rebooting modem, rebooting server. The logs dont even show anything, it says im teleporting out of map then it just stops.\nThe game works, but i cant leave the map. Please fix this, Ive been stuck in single maps for 5 days now.",
